{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2461,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.s3til.pcont",
  "name": "craftable containers",
  "slug": "craftable-containers",
  "teaser": "adds container progression through hideout crafts",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2LFUg9slZO1VSkDB6j4bUxqMyBaa9cIy3ag2KZYE.png",
  "downloads": 8286,
  "favourites_count": 12,
  "description": "<p>one of my favorite mods has always been Leaves’ Progressive Container</p>\n<p>that doesn’t work with 4.0, so i made my own without any coding experience. welcome s3til’s craftable containers. it’s the same concept, but with my own code and recipes using the WTT library</p>\n<hr />\n<p>features:</p>\n<p>-craft containers (wow)</p>\n<p>-fully customizable in db/CustomHideoutCrafts/[[Containername]].jsonc</p>\n<p>recipes are as follows by default (without listing specific items bc im lazy)</p>\n<ol>\n<li>waist bag -&gt; alpha @ lavatory 1</li>\n<li>alpha -&gt; beta @ workbench 2</li>\n<li>beta -&gt; epsi @ workbench 2</li>\n<li>epsi -&gt; theta @ intel 1</li>\n<li>theta -&gt; gamma @ medstation 3</li>\n<li>gamma -&gt; gamma+ @ workbench 3</li>\n</ol>\n<p>6b. get the kappa from collector</p>\n<ol start=\"7\">\n<li>kappa -&gt; kappa+ @ intel 3</li>\n</ol>\n<p>-trade in your starting container at Ragman 1 for a waist bag!</p>\n<p>config in config/barter.jsonc</p>\n<p>change “ContainerForTrade” string to the container your edition starts with (alpha, beta, gamma, unheard gamma) and Ragman will trade that starting container for a waistbag at LL1</p>\n<hr />\n<p>recommended mod pairings (aka also what i play with):</p>\n<p>SVM to change containers to be different (gamma and gamma eod, kappa and kappa desecrated, etc)</p>\n<p>profile modifier to give yourself a waistbag at the start</p>\n<p>profile modifier to give yourself The Collector at the start</p>\n<hr />\n<p>any problems and i guess lmk and ill try to fix it ive literally never coded anything before so this was all taken in chunks from WTT and SPT documentation</p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2461/craftable-containers",
